{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55229","headline":"朝海峰 · 秀登","name":"朝海峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万仞朝沧海，秋层上碧虚。\n峭欹云尽後，寒绮月生初。\n影落阳侯宅，根连觉帝居。\n谁能谢尘迹，向此结茅庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秀登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}